window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Being blindsided is never easy, even when you’re on the right track.</p> <p>Experimenting with technology that stretches our understanding of the universe, Connor and a small group of survivors find themselves stranded on a ship far beyond known space.</p> <p>The answers they seek may lie in a distant star system, but Connor is about to find out that not all encounters are by chance.</p> <p>With a crew size too small on a ship that is barely holding together, can Connor find a way to bring them home safe?</p> <p>Pathfinder is the 17th book in the bestselling military science fiction series, First Colony. Listen to the 17th book in this sprawling space opera today!</p>"; 
